      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path",
      "impact_statement": "PermLang installs minimatch only through ts-morph's @ts-morph/common, which calls it to match glob patterns against the files of an in-memory file system, or in getSourceFiles(patterns). PermLang uses neither: it reads files from disk, where ts-morph matches patterns with tinyglobby, and lists source files without patterns. test/vex.test.ts runs PermLang with minimatch replaced by a function that records every call, and expects none."
